{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And to Moses He said.</b> All that has been mentioned above until now — these are the conditions that he would recount to Israel. And afterward he said to Moses: after you make a covenant for them, you shall ascend — you and Aaron and his sons and seventy of the elders of Israel, who are the consecrated firstborn:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:51.610019576Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}